  "order": 1,
  "title": "What is this?",
  "goal": "Ask what something is, or who someone is, and answer with this, that and a.",
  "points": ["gp-demonstratives", "gp-bir-indefinite"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "Point and ask *Bu näme?* (what is this?). Answer *Bu kitap* (this is a book). For a person, ask *Bu kim?* (who is this?). *bu* is this, near you; *şu* is this right here; *ol* is that, farther away. *bir* means one, and sometimes a.",
    "see": "gp-demonstratives"
  },
